Description: Kora icon theme (rounded, colorful SVG icons with depth)
 SVG icon theme for GNU/Linux with rounded shapes, gradients and depth, and
 rounded blue folders. Includes the "Kora" and "Kora Grey" (grey folders)
 variants. Missing icons are inherited from Breeze.
